_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/6b02379c38f27cff4965a503f36711e0.avif?t=1785255293\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/ccc2773cb761345d3beca37ebae0a1d8.poster.avif?t=1785255293\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/ccc2773cb761345d3beca37ebae0a1d8.webm?t=1785255293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/ccc2773cb761345d3beca37ebae0a1d8.mp4?t=1785255293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cooperate to survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With proximity voice chat, solve puzzles together <span class=\"bb_strike\">and escape from sinister horrors</span> and have fun! <strong>You'll be dying to play again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/f260c21f90a68e90bab367ddab72af3b.avif?t=1785255293\" width=800 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/0e9ff79654ec9e9775effe5f70cea916.poster.avif?t=1785255293\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/extras/0e9ff79654ec9e9775effe5f70cea916.webm?t=1785255293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585760/ex